        "text": "Tch. Bloody lout... Light, stay cool for the moment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "I've seen you before. Hmm. So it was you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Unexpected, for sure. A Rim Billitonian, silently lurking in Shangshu since the very beginning."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "I can't understand you, sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
