    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "...A headless bolt."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "(H-He caught it barehanded? At this distance?! And I *just* changed the string on my crossbow\u2014!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Seeing how you're unwilling to take my life, I'll give you one chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Hand over the goblet to me, and then tell the one instructing you: Tread carefully. Don't be selfish."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Hmph. You know who hired me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Whether I know or not doesn't matter. What matters is I can stop you, right here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Why should I listen to you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "You have no choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Maybe you can run, but you could never bear to see these beasts of yours meet a sorry fate."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "You're threatening me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "You have skill. But aside from your crossbow, you've got nothing in a fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "You can pull out before you're in too deep. You need a good eye and the right people, if you want to survive here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "True. They never told me someone as capable as you would get in the way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "If I had someone do something dangerous for me, I wouldn't give them the whole picture either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "It's just a job to you, stranger. Why stake your life on it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Give the cup to me, and I vow on the Escorts' name that whatever they're paying you, we'll double it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Hah, I was taking a loss anyway with all my volunteer work."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Call this a favor for a friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "A friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "So even you bandits of the wild don't mind a sacrifice for a friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Sounds like you've got something against us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "No... not at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "The longer you do business, the more fine people you meet, the less friends you end up with."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Then be smart, and go back to your business."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Yes, business is always easiest done in the mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Three Mounts, Seventeen Peaks, hundreds of passes. Is there any road without a teahouse and station for travelers to rest their feet? Is there any road... without our people?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "I hope you see clear now, girl."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "You really don't think anything of me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "A direct confrontation might not be my style, but you've pissed me off just far enough... isn't that right, my darlings?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "(Rim Billitonian) The old todger wants to have a go, let's give 'im a go! We've been around the paddock a few times, we're no strangers!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "*Sigh*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Some just refuse to learn."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "If that's your answer, then you'll pay the\u2014"
    },
