    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "You finally came to the mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "So I came to find you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "*Sigh*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "What comes will come. Nothing's avoidable forever. Is there a need to be so hasty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Hey. Miss."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "...Are you talking to me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "(His movement\u2014is that wooden stick one of their carrying poles? What did he do just now... to shatter bricks made of stone?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Do you know him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Then there's some problem between you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "I only see you between us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "You're right. I'm your problem, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "When I'm done here, I'll come see you. But not now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Miss. Does this relate to the item in your hands?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Uh... it does..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "This is personal business. And major at that. Stay out of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "How major?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "The safety of the nation is at stake! Life and death!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "......!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Since that rainy night those years ago, I've rarely heard you use such a tone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "I see. How could you be the villain here? What a chivalrous swordsman. What a dutiful innkeeper."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Then get out of the way\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "\u2014But I know just who you are, and that's why you'll never see me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "And if you won't, then it changes nothing if I find you. That's why I never came down from the mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "So. If..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_punch",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Hey! You\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Give that back!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "It was ten years."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Ten years ago, you watched as my son died... so you could protect this goblet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Shang Zhong!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Miss. This is nothing to do with you now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "You steal my things while I'm not looking, and then tell me it's not my business?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "This was never yours."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Shang Zhong, have you lost it?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "You're free to go now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "Shang Zhong!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Leave!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Grr...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight",
        "text": "Mark my words, you two... I'll be back for it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "characteraction",
        "params": {
            "name": "middle",
            "type": "move",
            "x": 300,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Zheng Qingyue... Where's your blade?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "At home."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "I see. At home."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "That rainy night, in the escort, over a dozen lost their lives. There was a boy among them, and a father."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "The boy was a Shang. My boy. The father was a Du. Du Yaoye's father."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "That's why you don't carry your blade."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "What a tremendous joke."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "You still hate me to this day."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "I don't hate you. I know you didn't mean to. The blame lies with you, but no fault."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "'Save the goods, then the men,' hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "Yet the goods are gone now, and so are the men. Am I still not allowed to condemn you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "I must ask you give justification, or else I cannot live on."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng",
        "text": "I will. Give me the goblet. Do you know what it entails\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "No. He died for this cup then. I'll bury it beside him today."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier",
        "text": "I'll be waiting atop the mountain, for you to fetch your blade."
    },
    {
