    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Master Shen!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Boatman",
        "text": "Mm? What brought you over here? I was about to look for you at Liang's."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Boatman",
        "text": "Where's young Lee?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "The goblet got stolen. Mr. Lee sent us to fetch you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Did he tell you anything about this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Boatman",
        "text": "He asked you to come get me, but not to first find Mr. Liang?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Boatman",
        "text": "To be clear, you came from the Liang residence?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Er... yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Boatman",
        "text": "...*Sigh*. The fact he didn't send you to find Liang Xun means deep down, he already knows..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Boatman",
        "text": "Gifted, how gifted. How truly gifted."
    },
